{"article":{"id":360030873012,"url":"https://tenweb.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/360030873012.json","html_url":"https://help.10web.io/hc/en-us/articles/360030873012-What-Happens-if-I-Fail-to-Upgrade-My-Plan-Before-the-Free-Trial-Ends","author_id":5022262461202,"comments_disabled":false,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":4,"vote_sum":-5,"vote_count":5,"section_id":360005615952,"created_at":"2019-07-23T18:23:04Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T08:54:38Z","name":"What Happens if I Fail to Upgrade My Plan Before the Free Trial Ends?","title":"What Happens if I Fail to Upgrade My Plan Before the Free Trial Ends?","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2024-12-18T08:54:37Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":2179852,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":["automated wp platform"],"body":"<p>If you don't upgrade before the free trial ends, your website will be deleted after the trial expires. However, there is room for <a href=\"https://help.10web.io/hc/en-us/articles/360030873572-How-to-Recover-10Web-Hosted-Websites-That-Were-Deleted-on-Plan-Expiration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">recovering your website</a> once you upgrade.</p>"}}